"""Build the consolidated, deduped SEO backlog from the 113 raw specialist findings.
Each item merges cross-agent duplicates and carries the six 1-5 scoring fields the
score-opportunities.py model expects (priority = bv*so*gap*conf / (effort+risk)).
Scores are orchestrator judgements anchored to the three commercial priorities
(1 roast/food, 2 private hire, 3 events) and the without-data track (no GSC/GA4/CWV).
"""
import json, os

